  "name": "Italian Chocolate Spice Cookies",
  "subtitle": "Soft cocoa cookies with walnuts and a simple chocolate glaze",
  "description": "Tender spiced cocoa cookies shaped into rounds, baked until firm, and finished with a confectioners’ sugar glaze.",
